=begin

  saga-hl.lic

  Short-name launcher for saga_hl_sagapanel.lic so ;saga-hl works in game.

  The panel itself lives in saga_hl_sagapanel.lic. Keep both files together
  when sharing: this launcher only starts that script.

  Usage:
    ;saga-hl                 - Start the saga-hl Saga panel
    ;saga_hl_sagapanel       - Same, run the panel script directly

  Once the panel is running, use *hl help for commands.

  Saga-only. Requires Lich connected to the Saga frontend.

       creator: loraque (loraque@gmail.com)
        author: loraque (loraque@gmail.com)
          game: Gemstone
          tags: saga, frontend, panel, highlights, launcher
      required: Lich >= 5.12.0
       version: 0.1.1

  changelog:
    0.1.1 (2026-10-19)
      document pairing with saga_hl_sagapanel; [lich] story prefix on echoes
    0.1.0 (2026-10-18)
      initial launcher for saga_hl_sagapanel

=end

if Script.running?('saga_hl_sagapanel')
  echo '[lich] saga-hl: panel already running - *hl help'
else
  Script.start('saga_hl_sagapanel')
end
